{"id":"665018","name":"糖醋里脊","author":"双鱼座的美食","authorId":"11350065","desc":"","cover":"images/665018/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"猪里脊","amount":"两条"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"番茄酱","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"两条猪里脊，洗干净后顺丝切成这样的小条。","img":"images/665018/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加盐白胡椒粉黄酒腌十分钟。","img":"images/665018/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"两个蛋清加一勺淀粉搅拌均匀，我的蛋清没分好，你脑补一下吧。","img":"images/665018/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"倒入肉丝中。","img":"images/665018/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"挑一个面糊一个鸡蛋面粉淀粉1：1。","img":"images/665018/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加水搅拌成粘稠的糊糊。","img":"images/665018/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/665018/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"倒到腌好肉中，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/665018/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"热油八成热，冒烟。","img":"images/665018/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"挑小火，炸到变色，捞出。","img":"images/665018/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"这么多。","img":"images/665018/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"两根里脊，一共这么多。","img":"images/665018/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"挑一个糖醋汁：苹果醋，番茄酱，白糖1：1：0.5，如果肉淡，再放点盐。","img":"images/665018/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/665018/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"底油，下葱花，调好的糖醋汁翻炒到粘稠。","img":"images/665018/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"倒入里脊，翻炒均匀，撒上白芝麻，出锅。","img":"images/665018/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"原图。","img":"images/665018/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"美图。","img":"images/665018/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"原图。","img":"images/665018/step_19.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}